<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON SECOND DAY ORDER OF PLAY.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON SECOND DAY ORDER OF PLAY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Order of play on top courts for</p>
<p>Tuesday, the second day of the Wimbledon tennis championships</p>
<p>(prefix denotes seeding)</p>
<p>Centre court (starts 1300GMT)</p>
<p>8-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain) v Clare Wood (Britain)</p>
<p>7-Mark Philippoussis (Australia) v Greg Rusedski (Britain)</p>
<p>(resumes)</p>
<p>Chanda Rubin (U.S.) v Anna Kournikova (Russia)</p>
<p>5-Michael Chang (U.S.) v Todd Woodbridge (Australia)</p>
<p>Number One court (starts 1300GMT)</p>
<p>1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) v Anne Kremer (Luxembourg)</p>
<p>Michael Stich (Germany) v Jim Courier (U.S.) resumes</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) v Mikael Tillstrom (Sweden)</p>
<p>Number two court (starts 1100GMT)</p>
<p>10-Conchita Martinez v Karina Habsudova (Slovakia)</p>
<p>6-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) v Alexandra Fusai (France)</p>
<p>resumes</p>
<p>8-Boris Becker (Germany) v Marcos Gorriz (Spain)</p>
<p>3-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) v Juan-Antonio Marin (Spain)</p>
</text>
